 y is BYOB\, so alcohol may be present even though no age restriction is p
 ublished for the party itself. This event replaces the Foundation's origi
 nal April 25 walking-parade concept\, which was postponed for weather and
  reworked into this 5K and block party format.\nPrice: $15 per party\nAre
 a: Orange Beach & Gulf Shores\nTimes: Sat 9/12 · 5-10 PM\nChecked agains
